anzhang-q-o046","xiahoucao-q-o020","jfj-q0148","jfj-q0011","jfj-q0159","jfj-q0020","wgc-q0132","wgc-q0133","mantian-q-b4a050a731ef89b0b9fa","mantian-q-e2093a6f6a07520eef7b","huangli-q-3ffbe50380a5d4c5275d"],"facts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-f0035","label":"字","text":"仲权","evidence":["xiahoucao-f0035-q"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"仲权","evidence":["xiahoucao-f0035-q"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"guanzhang-m-o046-guanzhang-p0049","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-o046"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o020-guanzhang-p0049","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o020"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-p009-guanzhang-p0049","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p009"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-p063-guanzhang-p0049","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p063"]},{"id":"jfj-m-o037-guanzhang-p0049","kind":"mention","text":"本段记载：姜维与郭淮夏侯霸战于洮西","evidence":["jfj-q0011"]},{"id":"jfj-m-o042-guanzhang-p0049","kind":"mention","text":"本段记载：姜维夏侯霸洮西破王经并围狄道","evidence":["jfj-q0020"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p053-guanzhang-p0049","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及夏侯霸","evidence":["wgc-q0132"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p054-guanzhang-p0049","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及夏侯霸","evidence":["wgc-q0133"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q-a342a50fc1fc938d0d0d","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-9173784ede3ac5762e8f","layer":"original","quote":"维竟围经于狄道，城不能克","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":48,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":111,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-c878b5ebddd5713257f4","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-9173784ede3ac5762e8f","layer":"original","quote":"维至狄道，大破魏雍州刺史王经，经众死于洮水者以万计","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":48,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o046","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-9f348b83292228dfc790","layer":"original","quote":"七年卒〖3〗，追谥顺平侯。初，先主时，惟法正见谥。后主时，诸葛亮功德盖世，蒋琬、费祎荷国之重〖4〗，亦见谥。陈祗宠待〖5〗，特加殊奖；夏侯霸，远来归国〖6〗：故复得谥。于是关羽、张飞、马超、庞统、黄忠及云乃追谥，时论以为荣﹝二﹞。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-O053","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-4d2ab6578239f0eee393","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春正月，魏诛大将军曹爽等，右将军夏侯霸来降。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-O065","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-c3b5a23f5d44e3c1300b","layer":"original","quote":"夏，复率诸军出狄道，与魏雍州刺史王经战于洮西，大破之。经退保狄道城；维却住钟题〖14〗。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-9e754a9a399d9671f0b1","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-4595f049a60fc3e9a254","layer":"original","quote":"会经所统诸军于故关与贼战不利〖13〗，经辄渡洮〖14〗。泰以经不坚据狄道，必有他变；并遣五营在前，泰率诸军继之。经已与维战，大败；以万余人还保狄道城，余皆奔散。维乘胜围狄道","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":237,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-3ffbe50380a5d4c5275d","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-730caaec2cfa91bc7c10","layer":"pei","quote":"时车骑将军夏侯霸，谓嶷曰：‘虽与足下疏阔，然托心如旧，宜明此意","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":271,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-13c52b3cdb7a4e18c561","start":13,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0011","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-14772b9a3b2be1bc9c4e","layer":"original","quote":"十年〖4〗，迁卫将军；与大将军费祎共录尚书事。是岁，汶山平康夷反〖5〗，维率众讨定之。又出陇西、南安、金城界，与魏大将（军）郭淮、夏侯霸等战于洮西。胡王治无戴等举部落降，维将还安处之。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":177,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0012","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-136658a1b64846c0a25b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗十年：延熙十年（公元 247）。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6af8aac35085687baae2","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0020","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-5af1c31721bbfd739fd3","layer":"original","quote":"后十八年〖3〗，复与车骑将军夏侯霸等，俱出狄道，大破魏雍州刺史王经于洮西。经众死者数万人。经退保狄道城。维围之。魏征西将军陈泰进兵解围，维却住钟题〖4〗。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0148","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-14772b9a3b2be1bc9c4e","layer":"original","quote":"又出陇西、南安、金城界，与魏大将（军）郭淮、夏侯霸等战于洮西。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":177,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":43,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0159","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-5af1c31721bbfd739fd3","layer":"original","quote":"后十八年〖3〗，复与车骑将军夏侯霸等，俱出狄道，大破魏雍州刺史王经于洮西。经众死者数万人。经退保狄道城。维围之。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-b4a050a731ef89b0b9fa","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-6e1328e6a740a128ec3d","layer":"original","quote":"讨蜀护军夏侯霸督诸军屯为翅。淮军始到狄道，议者佥谓“宜先讨定枹罕〖13〗，内平恶羌，外折贼谋”。淮策维必来攻霸，遂入沨中〖14〗，转南迎霸。维果攻为翅，会淮军适至，维遁退。进讨叛羌，斩饿何、烧戈，降服者万余落","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":69,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-b7104f78b76870df9f04","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-c94e51255b13f14c5ce0","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗八年：正始八年（公元 247）。","attribution":"现代注释","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-322e12a2da059d43d188","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-c44c6e7c29f0e387b75e","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-35426a824e988af35226","layer":"modern","quote":"〖15〗九年：正始九年（公元 248）。","attribution":"现代注释","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7a85f1e5a526a58dd446","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-e2093a6f6a07520eef7b","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-a5b1ad11436e99dbc058","layer":"original","quote":"姜维出石营〖24〗，从强川〖25〗，乃西迎治无戴；留阴平太守廖化于成重山筑城〖26〗，敛破羌保质〖27〗。淮欲分兵取之，诸将以：“维众西接强胡，化已据险；分军两持，兵势转弱；进不制维，退不拔化：非计也。不如合而俱西，及胡、蜀未接，绝其内外。此伐交之兵也〖28〗”。淮曰：“今往取化，出贼不意，维必狼顾〖29〗。比维自致，足以定化〖30〗；且使维疲于奔命。兵不远西〖31〗，而胡交自离，此一举而两全之策也。”乃别遣夏侯霸等追维于沓中〖32〗，淮自率诸军就攻化等。维果驰还救化，皆如淮计。进封都乡侯","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":331,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":154,"end":401,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o076a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f3fdf2376549fb1e7ad9","layer":"original","quote":"八月，辛亥〖25〗，蜀卫将军姜维寇狄道〖26〗。雍州刺史王经与战洮西〖27〗。经大败，还保狄道城。辛未〖28〗，以长水校尉邓艾行安西将军〖29〗，与征西将军陈泰并力拒维〖30〗。戊辰〖31〗，复遣太尉司马孚为后继。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗二年：正元二年（公元 255）。乙丑：旧历十二日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-96103ace1e11ae4131ba","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o072","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4b9070779d1c209c6814","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月，乙丑〖6〗，镇东将军毌丘俭、扬州刺史文钦反。（戊戌）〔戊寅〕〖7〗，大将军司马景王征之。癸未〖8〗，车骑将军郭淮薨。闰月，己亥〖9〗，破钦于乐嘉〖10〗；钦遁走，遂奔吴。甲辰〖11〗，安风淮津都尉斩俭〖12〗，传首京都。﹝一﹞壬子〖13〗，复特赦淮南士民诸为俭、钦所诖误者〖14〗。以镇南将军诸葛诞为镇东大将军〖15〗。司马景王薨于许昌。二月，丁巳〖16〗，以卫将军司马文王为大将军〖17〗，录尚书事。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":207,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o076","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f3fdf2376549fb1e7ad9","layer":"original","quote":"八月，辛亥〖25〗，蜀卫将军姜维寇狄道〖26〗。雍州刺史王经与战洮西〖27〗。经大败，还保狄道城。辛未〖28〗，以长水校尉邓艾行安西将军〖29〗，与征西将军陈泰并力拒维〖30〗。戊辰〖31〗，复遣太尉司马孚为后继。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0132","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-8a04d9d66398f44d4332","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《世语》曰：“夏侯霸奔蜀，蜀朝问：‘司马公如何德？’霸曰：‘自当作家门。’‘京师俊士？’曰：‘有钟士季。其人管朝政，吴、蜀之忧也。’”","attribution":"世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":555,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-76e8e5c42343c71116a3","start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0133","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-721fceb4b6b206683a88","layer":"pei","quote":"《汉晋春秋》曰：“初，夏侯霸降蜀，姜维问之曰：‘司马懿既得彼政，当复有征伐之志不？’霸曰：‘彼方营立家门，未遑外事。有钟士季者，其人虽少，终为吴、蜀之忧；然非非常之人，亦不能用也。’后十五年而会果灭蜀。”","attribution":"汉晋春秋","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":556,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-76e8e5c42343c71116a3","start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0635","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-8a04d9d66398f44d4332","layer":"pei","quote":"夏侯霸奔蜀，蜀朝问：‘司马公如何德？’霸曰：‘自当作家门。’‘京师俊士？’曰：‘有钟士季。其人管朝政，吴、蜀之忧也","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":555,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-76e8e5c42343c71116a3","start":10,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0636","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-721fceb4b6b206683a88","layer":"pei","quote":"初，夏侯霸降蜀，姜维问之曰：‘司马懿既得彼政，当复有征伐之志不？’霸曰：‘彼方营立家门，未遑外事。有钟士季者，其人虽少，终为吴、蜀之忧；然非非常之人，亦不能用也。’后十五年而会果灭蜀","attribution":"裴注·汉晋春秋","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":556,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-76e8e5c42343c71116a3","start":9,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0698","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-4b11a09c81559216ebd0","layer":"pei","quote":"按习凿齿此言，非出他书，故采用《世语》而附益也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":557,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-76e8e5c42343c71116a3","start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o020b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fa4c25b726867680170c","layer":"original","quote":"黄初中，赐中子霸；太和中，赐霸四弟爵：皆关内侯。霸，正始中为讨蜀护军、右将军〖13〗，进封博昌亭侯。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o020c-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fa4c25b726867680170c","layer":"original","quote":"素为曹爽所厚，闻爽诛，自疑，亡入蜀。以渊旧勋，赦霸子，徙乐浪郡。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":92,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p009a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-94b2d845b1656ec51166","layer":"pei","quote":"黄初中，为偏将军。子午之役，霸召为前锋；进至兴势围，安营在曲谷中。蜀人望知其是霸也，指下兵攻之。霸手战鹿角间，赖救至，然后解。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-25ffcef69065f027e431","start":33,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p009b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-94b2d845b1656ec51166","layer":"pei","quote":"后为右将军，屯陇西。其养士、和戎，并得其欢心。至正始中，代夏侯儒为征蜀护军，统属征西：时征西将军夏侯玄，于霸为从子；而玄于曹爽为外弟。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-25ffcef69065f027e431","start":96,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p009c-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-94b2d845b1656ec51166","layer":"pei","quote":"及司马宣王诛曹爽，遂召玄，玄来东。霸闻曹爽被诛而玄又征，以为祸必转相及，心既内恐；又霸先与雍州刺史郭淮不和，而淮代玄为征西；霸尤不安，故遂奔蜀。南趋阴平而失道，入穷谷中。粮尽，杀马步行。足破，卧岩石上；使人求道，未知何之。蜀闻之，乃使人迎霸。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-25ffcef69065f027e431","start":163,"end":284,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p009f-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-94b2d845b1656ec51166","layer":"pei","quote":"及霸入蜀，禅与相见，释之曰：‘卿父自遇害于行间耳，非我先人之手刃也。’指其儿子以示之曰：‘此夏侯氏之甥也。’厚加爵宠。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-25ffcef69065f027e431","start":351,"end":410,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p063a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-a28301d33c65814e2e54","layer":"pei","quote":"初，夏侯霸将奔蜀，呼玄欲与之俱。玄曰：‘吾岂苟存自客于寇虏乎？’遂还京师。","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":622,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-31bf80f2d3548114eff9","start":9,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-f0035-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-94b2d845b1656ec51166","layer":"pei","quote":"霸字仲权","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-25ffcef69065f027e431","start":10,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o020","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fa4c25b726867680170c","layer":"original","quote":"渊妻，太祖内妹〖12〗。长子衡，尚太祖弟海阳哀侯女，恩宠特隆。衡袭爵，转封安宁亭侯。黄初中，赐中子霸；太和中，赐霸四弟爵：皆关内侯。霸，正始中为讨蜀护军、右将军〖13〗，进封博昌亭侯。素为曹爽所厚，闻爽诛，自疑，亡入蜀。以渊旧勋，赦霸子，徙乐浪郡。﹝一﹞霸弟威，官至兖州刺史。﹝二﹞威弟惠，乐安太守。﹝三﹞惠弟和，河南尹。﹝四﹞衡薨，子绩嗣，为虎贲中郎将。绩薨。子褒嗣。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p009","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-94b2d845b1656ec51166","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏略》曰：“霸字仲权。渊为蜀所害，故霸常切齿，欲有报蜀意。黄初中，为偏将军。子午之役，霸召为前锋；进至兴势围，安营在曲谷中。蜀人望知其是霸也，指下兵攻之。霸手战鹿角间，赖救至，然后解。后为右将军，屯陇西。其养士、和戎，并得其欢心。至正始中，代夏侯儒为征蜀护军，统属征西：时征西将军夏侯玄，于霸为从子；而玄于曹爽为外弟。及司马宣王诛曹爽，遂召玄，玄来东。霸闻曹爽被诛而玄又征，以为祸必转相及，心既内恐；又霸先与雍州刺史郭淮不和，而淮代玄为征西；霸尤不安，故遂奔蜀。南趋阴平而失道，入穷谷中。粮尽，杀马步行。足破，卧岩石上；使人求道，未知何之。蜀闻之，乃使人迎霸。初，建安五年，时霸从妹，年十三四，在本郡。出行樵采，为张飞所得。飞知其良家女，遂以为妻；产息女，为刘禅皇后。故渊之初亡，飞妻请而葬之。及霸入蜀，禅与相见，释之曰：‘卿父自遇害于行间耳，非我先人之手刃也。’指其儿子以示之曰：‘此夏侯氏之甥也。’厚加爵宠。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-25ffcef69065f027e431","start":0,"end":411,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p063","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-a28301d33c65814e2e54","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏氏春秋》曰：“初，夏侯霸将奔蜀，呼玄欲与之俱。玄曰：‘吾岂苟存自客于寇虏乎？’遂还京师。太傅薨，许允谓玄曰：‘无复忧矣！’玄叹曰：‘士宗！卿何不见事乎？此人犹能以通家年少遇我；子元、子上，不吾容也！’玄尝著《乐毅》、《张良》及《本无肉刑论》，辞旨通远，咸传于世。玄之执也，（卫将军）〔安东将军〕司马文王流涕请之。大将军曰：‘卿忘会赵司空葬乎？’先是，司空赵俨薨，大将军兄弟会葬，宾客以百数；玄时后至，众宾客咸越席而迎，大将军由是恶之。”","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":622,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-31bf80f2d3548114eff9","start":0,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
